            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 13,
              "start": 13
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked: \u201cNow what evidence is there that railroad workers who did that were or were not covered by this statutory language? And, if they were covered by it, do you lose?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2ddef3554d3b-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked: \u201cWhat about ticket agents? Are they included as transport workers under your approach?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2ddef3554d3b-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kavanaugh asked: \u201cIn your answers to the Chief Justice, you have two arguments, alternative arguments. Are you distinguishing your broader \u2018all airline workers\u2019 from your narrower argument, or am I misreading how you constructed your \u2013 your argument?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2ddef3554d3b-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kavanaugh, justice Kavanaugh followed up: \u201cBut, on your narrower argument, does that bring in then the gate ticket agents, or is that a question for another day, or where does that stand?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2ddef3554d3b-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked: \u201cWhat \u2013 to what industries would it apply besides the airlines?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2ddef3554d3b-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 61,
              "start": 61
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked: \u201cHow \u2013 how do you distinguish \u2013 trucking is in \u2013 you say trucking is in the exemption.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2ddef3554d3b-0002-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 64,
              "start": 64
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked: \u201cIf everybody who worked for the Cunard line was covered, what would be the point of \u2013 or that's not a \u2013 that's a passenger shipping line.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2ddef3554d3b-0002-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 65,
              "start": 65
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito further asked: \u201cSuppose it said seamen, railroad engineers, and others engaged in interstate or foreign commerce. Would everybody who worked for the railroad be covered?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2ddef3554d3b-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 66,
              "start": 66
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked: \u201cSo would \u2013 would \u2013 assume two things for me.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2ddef3554d3b7430bceec138581bb714ad46b67b2df3695672b091edc6e7f720",
            "evidence_ids": [
